{"summary":"Fuzzy House is an imaginative doll house - a playhome where kids can be kids!","description":"When you enter Fuzzy House, you enter a timeless world, that you can change and vitalize yourself. Kids can explore Fuzzy House, use their imagination and create their own stories as they play along.\n\nWhat is going to happen in the house is up to you and there is a lot to explore in our digital cosy dollhouse where the hand knitted Fuzzies live. Get cosy in the livingroom, let the Fuzzies take a bath or tuck them into bed. Interact with whatever objects you want. Change the weather, change the wallpapers, play the guitar, cook dinner or read a story.\n\nIn Fuzzy House you will meet no in-app purchases and no advertisements. There are no time limits, levels, scores or power ups – Fuzzy House is all about free open-ended and imaginative play. There are lots of things to discover and interact with and therefore plenty of replay value.\n\nFuzzy House is designed, so that 4 year olds as well as 9 year olds can use it – and have fun.\n\nWe are an award-winning company based in Copenhagen, Denmark.\nWe make digital toys that empower kids to be creative and to explore and discover. We see open-ended play as serious business that benefits kids' development and learning in many different ways.\n\nThe Fuzzy House app is supported by The Danish Film Institute, The Games Scheme.\n\nhttps://www.fuzzyhouse.com/fuzzy-house-app/\nhttps://www.facebook.com/fuzzyhouse\nhttps://www.instagram.com/fuzzyhouse/","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IVnB_x8R3sI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-wSrQZoGcQr6-cI-t_BzBx4m2R0uNIkZ4B-jtq_h3kkpzxWcVnGzVC5QvazK4aBn1vfPBEbi9FB0XJfdaasGaw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/P-0Uelt0wfA6awIyVJMqQXg8K02l90TUY188G8a_53180e0ra8UaRx6FXSxXIZEOkswoGH_KIqE5UcdD9ZZj","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G2lQmRC4ZitPQhggFP4bLsMA0w